==Trivia==
*In real life, [[wikipedia:Deneb|Deneb]] is the 19th-brightest star in the night sky and the brightest star in the constellation of Cygnus.
**Cygnus is the swan constellation, which is referenced by the enemy base's design, the [[Treasure]], and Deneb being represented by a swan on the map.
**In addition, the location of Deneb in the constellation suggests that it is at the head of the swan, which might explain the star-like shape near the beak of the swan on the enemy base.
*The base's design being an overweight swan huffing air is likely due to the fact that in Japanese, one character can be removed from Deneb (デネブ, ''denebu'') to spell "fat" (デブ, ''debu'').
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]] the base uses a recolor of [[Aldebaran (Cats of the Cosmos)|Aldebaran's base]].

